# Benchmark harness code is tracked; only its data and results are not.
# (This directory was previously ignored wholesale, which is why the scripts
# documented in benchmarking/README.md were absent from the repository.)
benchmarking/*
!benchmarking/README.md
!benchmarking/*.py
!benchmarking/ULVSH/
!benchmarking/PDBbind/
benchmarking/**/results/
benchmarking/**/*.csv
benchmarking/**/*.json

# Prepared benchmark inputs and results (regenerable from complexes/ + scripts)
benchmark_prepared/
benchmark_results/
complexes/

# SAIR training data and derived caches. sair.parquet is 635 MB and graph_cache
# reaches tens of GB over the full set; both live in S3 and are regenerable.
# A blob this size cannot be removed from history later without a force-push.
sair.parquet
cif_index.json
graph_cache/
*.cif
preprocess.log
